  <item>
    <title>脱5选手呼兰：切几刀，这还是同一块蛋糕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637603f5f628cd6b20cba8e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637603f5f628cd6b20cba8e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Nov 2022 09:50:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」，本期的嘉宾是脱5总冠军呼兰。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他跟朋友们在青岛待了五个月。每天写稿，去开放麦，再回来写稿，除了睡觉的时候，呼兰的房间里似乎永远有人在聊段子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年最后一期「从段子到段子」，我们试图跟呼兰打听，冠军旗帜掉下前，他度过的那五个月。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 庆功宴结束的第二天排满了采访，谁当大王谁被采</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 呼兰不会专门挑负面情绪创作，但今年是负面情绪先动的手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> 英雄梦的破灭是一场循序渐进的接受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 如果有新人特别好，或者张博洋来了，大家就会去看开放麦围观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 时间拉长，确实事都不是事儿了，可人等不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 青岛集体写稿生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> 笑依然是生活的麻药，甚至剂量都有点不够了</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《这一切没有想象的那么糟》- 万晓利</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li6bq3xID8ZoUkl40X1sz5B-MzYd.m4a" length="99705463" type="audio/mp4"/>
