  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱5选手童漠男：你要把生活中所有的便宜都占尽吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636ccc1f165a4944db4977ff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636ccc1f165a4944db4977ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Nov 2022 10:02:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」，本期的嘉宾是童漠男。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上周《脱5》半决赛突围赛，童漠男讲了前后打磨两年的段子，北下关。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们第一次听到是在李诞的专场。那天童漠男开场，讲了 15 分钟，办公室去看的朋友当晚就建了一个群聊，叫「北下关小学名誉校友会」，可见快乐的后劲有多大。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在你们都听到了，所以想让他从头再聊聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个阳光明媚的下午，童漠男坐在四楼沙发，从头聊了聊他的今年和北下关。</span></p><span></span><p><span>p.s. 本期的片尾是童老师自己参与的歌曲，希望我们以后有更多嘉宾自带BGM。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> &nbsp;人有焦虑，因为人太聪明了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 童漠男和张博洋一起写了个关于网络的段子，请大家去线下看吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 《那年夏天，宁静的海》，一种克制的离别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> 一个人的弱点反而成为了他的武器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1421">23:41</a> 喜剧节目能竞演，会不会是因为人天生就爱卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 爸妈最开始想别耽误漠男，后来觉得可能真不是这块料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> 养孩子是一种怎样的情感体验？童漠男很好奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 节目上的表演有点像写作文，还有老师在金句上画波浪线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 人的快乐是对未来有美好的预期，比如小学生春游前夜，而不是实现本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一笑置之》- 小老虎/也是福/周士爵/童漠男</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpltnE0Pd6HE62vKBSG9oIIvYhb9.m4a" length="114845762" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwenRXcU15YmVYbUd0R196ZldvWjcxb2lWSm8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱5选手小佳：「人设」崩塌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63636e1f2e925d51c11947f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63636e1f2e925d51c11947f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Nov 2022 07:30:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」，有一阵子不见了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是《脱口秀大会5》选手，昨天遗憾止步半决赛前的小佳。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采访小佳那天，他来公司上表演课，练了好长一段台词，对录播客信心满满，还帮我们念了开头。「早知道（要录）就叫你们去厦门了。」</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 小佳现场实践表演课成果（但你们看不到）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 同吃不同睡的录制生活，凌晨三点摇人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 大木来找小佳喝酒，说好了喝个痛快，一瓶啤酒后他回去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 每个人最值得学习的是自己，小佳叫你们别学他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 以前没听说过，但现在爱上了地狱笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> 观众发现脱口秀演员，也在他们身上看到自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a> 爸爸还生活在小佳的段子里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2676">44:36</a> 小佳在主打秀的尾声，有了一场跨时空对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> 接到商务了，想再接点节目，恋综也行</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Rollin' On》- 椅子乐团</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqmzNtIa0OrYpQ7fomoVv29LJMhf.m4a" length="119346689" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoNGEzeTN4VGRNZzB2Q0loZjU3WDVzVWtXc0YucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
