  <item>
    <title>脱5选手孟川：想写个寓言，你听到的只是表面</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6347cc229186d4e4c46a0ffa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6347cc229186d4e4c46a0ffa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Oct 2022 08:28:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」。每期我们会请一位《脱口秀大会5》的参赛选手来聊 ta 的段子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是脱口秀演员孟川。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期的封面照片是孟川自己选的，他说：挺喜欢这种隔了一层的感觉。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> &nbsp;今年本来想做腹语脱口秀，为此买了一个木偶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> &nbsp;孟川最擅长的素材是「阴阳」别人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> &nbsp;当我们想讽刺时，能不能演那个「坏人」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> &nbsp;反馈慢可能是一件好事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> &nbsp;没法上班的孟川：我又不喜欢惯着领导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a> &nbsp;cp文和喜剧都在用另一个方式解释同一件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> &nbsp;川哥本来想考研，但发现太影响挣钱了，孩子上学好贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 成年人一直在锻炼自己的忍受能力</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《逃跑的木偶》- 郝云</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
