  <item>
    <title>脱5选手鸟鸟：敲出裂缝</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633ea32f2a992d56e91e5655</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633ea32f2a992d56e91e5655</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Oct 2022 09:43:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」。每期我们会请一位《脱口秀大会5》的参赛选手来聊 ta 的段子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是脱口秀演员鸟鸟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开始采访前，鸟鸟碰到孟川。他要趁放假回上海带孩子，想把滑板留给呼兰，但是呼兰不会滑。鸟鸟小声地说：「我会。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>然后很开心地把滑板拿走了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们猜你也不知道，鸟鸟会玩滑板。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> 鸟鸟说，这么多负面情绪，不搞脱口秀可惜了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 青春小说里瘦弱的女主角常让鸟鸟郁闷，自己是不是太能吃了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 大家都很焦虑，卷可能是获得控制感的一种行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 写健身段子，把办卡的钱挣回来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 脱口秀演员总想唱唱反调，接个下茬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3119">51:59</a> 我们倾向于觉得自己的感受不重要，就像长辈从不讲述自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">56:04</a> 因为写了关于内向的段子，得到更多的社交包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3674">61:14</a> 死亡事关每个人，但大家常常避而不谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3973">66:13</a> 那些普遍的困惑，没有答案也没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Keeping Your Head Up》- Birdy</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
