  <item>
    <title>脱5选手颜怡颜悦：世界上有一些隐隐流动的东西</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632c3252e67030aadb38e2ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632c3252e67030aadb38e2ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Sep 2022 10:00:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这期「从段子到段子」的嘉宾是一个双胞胎，刚刚告别《脱口秀大会5》的颜怡颜悦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们第一次分开采访了颜怡和颜悦，在同一个房间的同一个位置。跟她们聊了关于脱口秀、小说、舞台剧、节目、朋友……以及颜怡和颜悦今年的创作和生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span>【颜悦】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 分开两个月见到颜怡的第一秒，颜悦觉得自己活过来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 双胞胎的创作模式：分开创作，互相挑刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 写小说又不是写遗言，干嘛要那么完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> &nbsp;生活比段子荒诞太多，但它是创作的来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">23:49</a> &nbsp;那些过去为一部分人设计的世界，今天另一部分人可以提出异议吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> &nbsp;颜悦会为大家开始关心别人而开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 现实主义小说的伟大是描述了我们不敢承认的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span>【颜怡】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">46:18</a> 双胞胎通感：发生在对方身上的事情，以为也发生在自己身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> 颜怡最近在学心理学，得到了久违的人文关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 每个女性都需要表达的舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3663">61:03</a> 恰恰是那些小事，让你一步一步觉得没那么有话语权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3991">66:31</a> &nbsp;不害怕争议，想听到回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4820">80:20</a> 三弟，鸟鸟，颜怡颜悦的友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4981">83:01</a> 「写作像一把劈向冰封大海的斧子」，而她希望它能传播下去</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Time Traveling》-Anthony Lazaro/Sarah Kang</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Message in the Wind》-Nai Br.XX/Celeina Ann</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmY0Wn9cIr0XN8rYOROn90Hx0ody.m4a" length="172043759" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnUC04elA3N0JBSElWRVI4T2xHcnFrWFZJNEYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱5选手毛豆：讲脱口秀之前，好像什么也没做好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632314f81a7a343bb7bb511d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632314f81a7a343bb7bb511d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Sep 2022 12:05:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>单集简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「从段子到段子」。每期我们会请一位《脱口秀大会5》的参赛选手，做一个小访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是脱口秀演员毛豆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年底我们就在笑果训练营见过毛豆。有一天早上，他给自己整了一个特别精致的小三明治。卖相过于精美，被别的学员误以为是酒店提供的早餐，吃掉了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>毛豆委屈。学员道了歉，并表示：很好吃！</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 毛豆提前半小时到了公司，在门口等一个看过节目的同事能带他进去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> &nbsp;录制节目的黄岛是福地，当了八年兵，战友们现在也经常去看他的开放麦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> &nbsp;相亲没有成功，但是看到了咖啡厅牌子上的喜剧厂牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 打车遇到师傅在看自己的纯享片段，毛豆热心剧透「这个猪站起来了」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> &nbsp;毛豆妈看完《士兵突击》，过于喜欢，直接让毛豆去当兵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> 观众私信：「好喜欢你的卤大肠」。仿佛参加不是脱5，是厨艺争霸赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1966">32:46</a> &nbsp;出海的人有一种普遍的心态：随缘</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《阿司匹林》- 王以太</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu5OxLtLJx0HR1vs8-lFDye5hP01.m4a" length="85306263" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2eHdqUnpGaHI2VS1idmxCOU5VQVY0QnJLbGoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
