  <item>
    <title>脱5选手House：脱口秀大会老给我一种九局下半的感觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631de1faf3d15f16f4cc32cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">631de1faf3d15f16f4cc32cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Sep 2022 13:26:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这里是「从段子到段子」。每期我们会请一位《脱口秀大会5》的参赛选手，做一个小访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是脱口秀演员House。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于他坚持不用提纲，聊了很久、很散漫，但我们保证，说的都是真话。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 最好的梗都不在计划里要写的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 脱口秀演员和小说家的共性：找到人物弧光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 学金融是为了把爸爸炒股输的钱赚回来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 人生总比投资更有容错率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 少年热血漫和普通人的区别：我们不能一直变身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> House反省自己的问题：中文不好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a>「怎么表达」和「表达什么」一样重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 高考作文和脱口秀文本很像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> House的龟派气功攒大招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 有点怕和呼兰撞投资梗，亏得还没人家多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a> 最近的社交偏好是在一群社恐里当社牛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3667">61:07</a> 九局下半：这场比赛仍然有理论上的可能</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《California Dreamin'》 - The Mamas &amp; the Papas</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍️</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>*感谢小宇宙协助录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmr4IERWKO83LmwbBezBeNZ_0r3l.m4a" length="145202512" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtTHFpbWg4a0lHOFFJZ25qNmFTU19uM3N3X2oucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱5选手黄大妈：我的退休计划里没有脱口秀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631071d343274df80456cd33</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">631071d343274df80456cd33</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Sep 2022 08:48:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>单集简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是笑果一档新的访谈播客节目，「从段子到段子」。每周四我们会请一位《脱口秀大会5》的参赛选手，来做一个小访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「从段子到段子」其实是2020年夏天，「笑果工厂」公众号开始做的栏目。每年跟随比赛，我们都会找脱口秀演员坐下聊聊，试图对他们的段子进行一些幽默解构，聊聊他们的创作和生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的嘉宾是《脱5》第一轮选手，58岁的新人演员黄大妈。获得四灯晋级之后，她选择了退赛。</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 如果早说要拍照，黄大妈会带两条丝巾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 黄大妈区分商演和开放麦的方式——看票价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 为了投稿，黄大妈找没退休的闺蜜借了电子邮箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> &nbsp;听黄大妈讲1986年的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a> &nbsp;黄大妈和家里人说的是：她来跳广场舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> &nbsp;观众看大妈讲脱口秀，可能像大人看小孩背唐诗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 退赛是参加比赛之前就做好的决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 脱口秀只属于年轻人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 黄大妈的退休爱好推荐：钢琴，或者脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Mix It Up》- RalphReal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《梦伴》 - 梅艳芳</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划：帼蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影&amp;设计：文森特</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客封面设计：旎旎</span></p><span></span><p><span>*感谢长沙笑嘛脱口秀俱乐部协助录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多内容可关注「笑果工厂」公众号与微博。</span></p>]]></description>
